; onehotr_spin_model_no_grid: on a spin model, NonBinaryModel comes before the
; grid precondition.
;
; spec/xqvm/ISA.md raises NonBinaryModel right after the model type check and
; before any check against the model. This model has no grid, so on a binary
; model ONEHOTR would raise InvalidGridDimensions; on a spin model the domain
; check runs first.

PUSH 4
SQMX r0          ; spin model, 4 variables, no RESIZE
PUSH 0           ; row
PUSH 1           ; penalty
ONEHOTR r0
HALT
